      "context": "Phone outline row, laid out by coordinate so the themed state layers can sit behind the content. OR-Tint is the $v-select selection wash and OR-TouchBar the 3pt actor bar for a row touched in the last 30s: both ship disabled/enabled and are switched with `override <inst>/OR-Tint enabled=true` — a bool, which keeps lint clean, where an override carrying a $variable would not. OR-Indent's width is one level of depth (14pt). Vertical rhythm is 7pt, not DESIGN.md's 2pt row-y: a 19pt row is not tappable.",
